# calculator
a simple python that multiplies two numbers together
num1 = int(input('Enter a number: '))
num2 = int(input('Enter a second number: '))
num3 = num1 * num2
print(num3)
## Features
- Takes two numeric inputs from the user
- Multiplies them together
- Displays the relults
## Requirements
- Python3.x
